## PRODUCT = displacements / what the file holds
## OTSWAPV = 0.2.1 / otswap version
## GEOMETRY = lightcone / geometry of the reconstruction
## NOBJECTS = 500 / number of input objects
## NREC = 2 / realizations
## SEED = 2026 / seed of the random streams
## CONVERG = 0.001 / convergence threshold of the swap loop
## CELLSIZE = 4 / grid cell size, in units of the mps
## REJCROSS = 1 / config: reject mask crossings
## CFMAXPIX = 0 / config: unobserved pixels a displacement may cross
## VERBOSE = silent / what the call reported
## ZCUTMIN = 0.25 / lower bound of the redshift cut
## ZCUTMAX = 0.65 / upper bound of the redshift cut
## MASK = 1 / objects selected by a mask
## FILTNSID = 16 / NSIDE of the mask filter
## MAXPIXCR = 0 / unobserved pixels a displacement may cross
## NTRAC = 500 / tracers given
## NTRCUT = 95 / of them, outside the redshift cut
## NTRMASK = 62 / of them, on an unobserved pixel
## NTRBOTH = 14 / of them, outside both
## NRAND = 2500 / randoms given
## NRNCUT = 480 / of them, outside the redshift cut
## NRNMASK = 332 / of them, on an unobserved pixel
## NRNBOTH = 61 / of them, outside both
## NDISPL = 714 / valid displacements before the filters
## NDISPCR = 30 / of them, rejected as crossing the mask
# id                   tracer ID; its input row, from 0, when no IDs were set
# tracRA               observed right ascension, declination and redshift of the tracer [deg]
# tracDec              observed right ascension, declination and redshift of the tracer [deg]
# tracRed              observed right ascension, declination and redshift of the tracer
# lagrRA               sky coordinates of the mean Lagrangian position; redshift NaN beyond the distance table [deg]
# lagrDec              sky coordinates of the mean Lagrangian position; redshift NaN beyond the distance table [deg]
# lagrRed              sky coordinates of the mean Lagrangian position; redshift NaN beyond the distance table
# tracX                comoving position of the tracer
# tracY                comoving position of the tracer
# tracZ                comoving position of the tracer
# lagrX                mean Lagrangian position, tracer + mean displacement
# lagrY                mean Lagrangian position, tracer + mean displacement
# lagrZ                mean Lagrangian position, tracer + mean displacement
# displX               mean displacement over the valid realizations
# displY               mean displacement over the valid realizations
# displZ               mean displacement over the valid realizations
# nValidRec            number of valid realizations of the tracer
# outsideRedshiftCut   1 if left out of the reconstruction by the redshift cut
# outsideMask          1 if left out of the reconstruction by the mask
#
###   id   tracRA   tracDec   tracRed   lagrRA   lagrDec   lagrRed   tracX   tracY   tracZ   lagrX   lagrY   lagrZ   displX   displY   displZ   nValidRec   outsideRedshiftCut   outsideMask
